Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `values[…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `second`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/mutable_view_list_elements_must_be_disjoint.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     second: &values[0..1]
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212

Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: List elements create overlapping views of `values[…]`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/mutable_view_list_elements_must_be_disjoint.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     return [first, second]
    |                    ^^^^^^
 Why: List elements coexist, so an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap another element's view
 Fix: Use disjoint ranges, keep only one mutable view, or store owned values
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
